  "question": {
    "text": "The value of $\\cot ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{1+\\tan ^2(2)}-1}{\\tan (2)}\\right)-\\cot ^{-1}$<br/>$\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{1+\\tan ^2\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)}+1}{\\tan \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)}\\right) \\text { is equal to }$",
    "image": null
  },
